// Avdiivka, part II, The second wave (Друга хвиля): 19 October 2023, morning, the northern shoulder. The Russians
// come again, having learned: smaller groups under more smoke, the infantry dismounting at the belts, and the heap
// stormed on foot with tanks at its base (c11 §2 19-20 Oct, §6 set piece 2, folded in from about 16 October:
// design/avdiivka.md). The schema is bav_core::data and bav_sim::data; the map is map.ron.
(
    date: "19 October 2023",
    tally_date: "19 OCT 2023",
    // 06:30 to about 13:00 in the day's 1500 s.
    day_start_min: 390.0,
    compression: 0.26,
    attacker: Ru,
    season: Autumn,
    // 19 October is the 292nd day of the year; Kyiv was on summer time, UTC+3.
    sun: (292, 3.0),
    // The 47th flew thermal Mavics by then: key I.
    thermal: true,
    // Fictional, the 47th's: the player (a sighthound), the 55th's guns (anvil), the observers on the heap (crest),
    // the battalion's command post (flint).
    callsigns: (
        player: ("Khort", "Хорт"),
        guns: ("Kovadlo", "Ковадло"),
        op: ("Hrebin", "Гребінь"),
        command: ("Kremin", "Кремінь"),
    ),
    words: (
        briefing: r#"AVDIIVKA (АВДІЇВКА), THE NORTHERN SHOULDER
19 OCTOBER 2023, MORNING

Avdiivka has been a fortified salient since 2014, ten kilometres from Donetsk. Its northern anchor is the coke
plant; north of the plant stands its spoil heap, and beyond the heap the village of Stepove on the railway.
Open stubble fields run from both towards Krasnohorivka and Kamianka, where the Russians are.

You are with the 47th Mechanised Brigade (47-ма ОМБр), moved here from Zaporizhzhia with little time to rest:
a drone operator and a fire controller at Stepove. The 110th holds the heap. The 55th Artillery Brigade's guns
are behind you, and for once there are shells.

Nine days ago they lost a brigade's worth of armour in these fields. The wrecks are still there. Today they come
again, with more smoke and fewer vehicles to a group, and they mean to take the heap.

The day will run whether or not you do anything. What you do matters at the margin.

Mouse: right-drag to look, wheel to zoom.  WASD: fly the drone.  Q/E: turn.  R/F: climb/descend.
Left click: 155 mm fire mission (4 rounds).  Shift+click: cluster shells.  Ctrl+click: HIMARS.  4: an FPV.
C: drop a grenade from the drone (it falls in the wind: go low, and allow for it).
Space: ATGM teams AUTO / HOLD / FREE.  1/2 or Tab: drone / the observers on the heap.  I: thermal.  P: pause.  [ ]: time.
M: move the drone team when they find you.  3: into a position with an ATGM team.  Right button: the sight.  Left click: launch.
6: into a Bradley's gunner's seat (again for the next).  Right button: the sight.  Left click: a burst.  X: AP / HE.  T: a TOW.
5: out with an Igla team (again for the next).  Right button: shoulder it.  Left click: launch, on the steady tone.

Press Enter."#,
        op_label: "OBSERVERS, THE HEAP'S FIRST TERRACE (СПОСТЕРІГАЧІ, ПЕРША ТЕРАСА ТЕРИКОНУ)",
        op_lost: "The observers on the heap are gone. No eyes from the height.",
        forward_belt: "the railway",
        plow_mine: "Mine under the plow. The lead tank's plow is gone, it keeps going.",
        mine_lines: [
            "Mine! He went off the track. That one's done.",
            "Another one. Tracks off.",
            "He drove right past the last one, same line. Mine.",
            "Boom. Mine. He's not moving.",
        ],
        registered: ("Я {guns}. Вогонь по пристріляній точці {n}.", "This is {guns}. Firing on registered point {n}."),
        closing: [
            "The General Staff claimed almost 50 tanks and over 100 armoured vehicles across the salient that day. After October the Russians attacked on foot.",
            "The heap fell on 28 October. The city held until 17 February 2024.",
        ],
        keys: "R: the same morning again, across the same field.     Esc: quit.",
        sources: [
            (
                publisher: "Institute for the Study of War",
                date: "11 Oct 2023",
                title: "Russian Offensive Campaign Assessment",
                url: "https://understandingwar.org/research/russia-ukraine/russian-offensive-campaign-assessment_11-14/",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "OSW",
                date: "13 Oct 2023",
                title: "Battle of Avdiivka. Day 596 of the war",
                url: "https://www.osw.waw.pl/en/publikacje/analyses/2023-10-13/battle-avdiivka-day-596-war",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "Euromaidan Press",
                date: "16 Oct 2023",
                title: "Frontline report: Russia's failed frontal assault on Avdiivka coal spoil tip",
                url: "https://euromaidanpress.com/2023/10/16/frontline-report-russias-failed-frontal-assault-on-avdiivka-coal-spoil-tip-shows-russian-strategic-lapses/",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "Frontelligence Insight",
                date: "23 Oct 2023",
                title: "Avdiivka: Russian losses from October 10 to 20",
                url: "https://frontelligence.substack.com/p/avdiivka-russian-losses-from-october",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "FDD's Long War Journal",
                date: "Mar 2024",
                title: "Battle of Avdiivka: a preliminary analysis",
                url: "https://www.longwarjournal.org/archives/2024/03/battle-of-avdiivka-a-preliminary-analysis.php",
            ),
            (
                publisher: "Wikipedia",
                date: "2024",
                title: "Battle of Avdiivka (2023–2024)",
                url: "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Avdiivka_(2023%E2%80%932024)",
            ),
        ],
    ),

    // What the first wave left in the fields (part I's band: about thirty-five hulls on the two lanes), where they
    // stopped: beside the lanes, a few turned back.
    old_wrecks: [
        (At((1206.0, 1415.8)), -0.45),
        (At((1211.2, 1313.1)), 3.08),
        (At((1175.2, 1238.0)), 0.13),
        (At((1167.6, 1148.9)), -0.45),
        (At((1177.5, 1088.3)), 0.06),
        (At((1176.1, 972.9)), 3.19),
        (At((1222.9, 921.8)), -0.03),
        (At((1154.4, 838.9)), -0.26),
        (At((1190.8, 708.0)), 3.62),
        (At((1131.8, 620.8)), -0.08),
        (At((1182.0, 571.0)), -0.15),
        (At((1122.6, 497.1)), -0.03),
        (At((1167.8, 368.0)), -0.11),
        (At((1120.8, 307.2)), -0.01),
        (At((1159.9, 208.3)), 3.51),
        (At((1102.0, 135.1)), 0.36),
        (At((1169.6, 57.6)), -0.35),
        (At((1160.2, -21.5)), -0.32),
        (At((1157.4, -112.8)), 0.19),
        (At((1091.8, -205.6)), 0.37),
        (At((-310.6, 1295.3)), -0.4),
        (At((-354.6, 1240.2)), -0.39),
        (At((-380.0, 1113.4)), 3.26),
        (At((-308.1, 1031.9)), 0.1),
        (At((-330.4, 949.8)), 2.95),
        (At((-325.5, 844.2)), 2.8),
        (At((-393.9, 747.6)), 0.41),
        (At((-400.3, 642.3)), -0.24),
        (At((-349.3, 557.5)), 0.11),
        (At((-413.8, 500.3)), 0.24),
        (At((-425.9, 385.8)), 0.29),
        (At((-371.8, 297.3)), 0.44),
        (At((-407.0, 208.1)), -0.03),
        (At((-428.1, 57.2)), 0.15),
    ],
    // Overcast by the 20th, with the wind gusting to 33 km/h (ERA5, c11 §3): the drone works for its hover.
    overcast: true,
    wind: (-6.0, 0.0, 4.5),

    // ---- The battle's part (bav_sim::data) ----
    // The 47th's and the 110th's side as Units and Support: Stugna and Javelin teams and rifle sections for the
    // positions, a tank and the Bradleys for the hides, and the 55th's guns with a working day's rounds and cluster
    // shells. FPVs were a daily stock by this autumn (arcs.md §6).
    catalog: [
        (
            id: "stugna",
            name: ("Stugna-P team", "Розрахунок «Стугни-П»"),
            what: Post(Stugna),
            cost: 8,
            supply: 5,
            available: 5,
        ),
        (
            id: "javelin",
            name: ("Javelin team", "Розрахунок «Джавеліна»"),
            what: Post(Javelin),
            cost: 9,
            supply: 5,
            available: 4,
        ),
        (
            id: "rifles",
            name: ("Rifle section", "Стрілецьке відділення"),
            what: Post(None),
            cost: 3,
            supply: 2,
            available: 9,
        ),
        // The 47th's Igla teams (c11 §4: the Su-25s forced in close were the ones lost, five aircraft in ten days
        // over the whole salient), riflemen round a team of two missiles.
        (
            id: "igla",
            name: ("Igla team, 2 missiles", "Розрахунок «Ігли», 2 ракети"),
            what: Air(Igla(2)),
            cost: 7,
            supply: 6,
            available: 3,
        ),
        (id: "tank", name: ("Tank in a hide", "Танк у капонірі"), what: Hide, cost: 10, supply: 6, available: 3),
        // The 47th's Bradleys hull-down at the hides, a gunner's seat the player can take (key 6).
        (
            id: "m2",
            name: ("Bradley in a hide", "«Бредлі» у капонірі"),
            what: Dug(Bradley),
            cost: 9,
            supply: 6,
            available: 4,
        ),
        (id: "bradley", name: ("Bradley", "«Бредлі»"), what: Vehicle(Bradley), cost: 7, supply: 6, available: 6),
        (id: "mtlb", name: ("MT-LB", "МТ-ЛБ"), what: Vehicle(Mtlb), cost: 4, supply: 4, available: 3),
    ],
    support: [
        (id: "155", name: ("155 mm, 16 rounds", "155 мм, 16 пострілів"), what: Shells(16), cost: 4, available: 10),
        (id: "raam", name: ("RAAM mission", "Дистанційне мінування (RAAM)"), what: Raam, cost: 3, available: 6),
        // Cluster shells: the 55th's DPICM, two to a mission, for the infantry in the open (c11 §5).
        (
            id: "dpicm",
            name: ("Cluster mission, 2 shells", "Касетні, 2 снаряди"),
            what: Cluster(1),
            cost: 2,
            available: 8,
        ),
        (id: "himars", name: ("HIMARS mission", "Удар HIMARS"), what: Himars, cost: 8, available: 2),
        (
            id: "brigade",
            name: ("Brigade guns, 20 rounds", "Бригадна артилерія, 20 пострілів"),
            what: Brigade(20),
            cost: 2,
            available: 10,
        ),
        (
            id: "mortar",
            name: ("120 mm mortars, 20 bombs", "Міномети 120 мм, 20 мін"),
            what: Mortar(20),
            cost: 1,
            available: 10,
        ),
        (id: "fpv", name: ("FPV strike drone", "FPV-дрон"), what: Fpv, cost: 2, available: 20),
        (id: "mavic", name: ("Two more Mavic 3s", "Ще два Mavic 3"), what: Mavic(2), cost: 3, available: 2),
        // Grenades for the Mavic to drop: two VOG-17s on its release a sortie (db/research/10-drones-ua-2023.md §5).
        (
            id: "vog",
            name: ("Two VOG-17s for the Mavic", "Два ВОГ-17 для «Мавіка»"),
            what: Drops(2),
            cost: 1,
            available: 8,
        ),
    ],
    // The Record: the ATGM teams at the village's edge and along the railway, riflemen on the heap and at the
    // plant's corner, two Bradleys and a tank in the village's hides, 96 rounds, three RAAM missions, four cluster, one
    // HIMARS, a dozen FPVs, and eight grenades for the drone to drop on the men climbing the heap.
    allotment: (
        points: 180,
        supply: (12, 2.0),
        record: [
            (id: "stugna", at: 0),
            (id: "javelin", at: 1),
            (id: "rifles", at: 2),
            (id: "stugna", at: 3),
            (id: "igla", at: 4),
            (id: "rifles", at: 5),
            (id: "igla", at: 6),
            (id: "rifles", at: 7),
            (id: "rifles", at: 8),
            (id: "m2", at: 9),
            (id: "m2", at: 10),
            (id: "tank", at: 11),
            (id: "155", count: 6),
            (id: "raam", count: 3),
            (id: "dpicm", count: 4),
            (id: "himars", count: 1),
            (id: "brigade", count: 6),
            (id: "mortar", count: 6),
            (id: "fpv", count: 12),
            (id: "vog", count: 4),
        ],
    ),
    old_wreck_kinds: [T72, Bmp2, Bmp1, Mtlb, T80, Bmp2, Bmp2, T72, Bmp1, Bmp2, Mtlb, T72],
    space_key: Atgm,
    // Shift+click: cluster on the infantry. (RAAM stays on the stock for Command's table.)
    shift_fire: Cluster,
    // Their guns work the village, the railway and the heap all day, and the ground behind.
    ru_guns: Posts(x: (-1800.0, 1800.0), band: (-1300.0, -600.0)),
    registered_fire: (50.0, 6),
    // Their EW: jammers with the columns' start lines, the rear emitters past the heap's far foot.
    ew: (jammers: [(1300.0, 1700.0), (-900.0, 1750.0)], radius: 900.0, depth: 700.0),
    // FPVs by the day, five minutes in the air.
    fpv: (endurance: 300.0),
    // Command's Enemy staff: Lancets for the Bradleys and the tank; Orlans over the village every few minutes; KABs
    // and Su-25 pairs on the posts and hides it has spotted.
    staff: (lancets: 4, orlan: (120.0, 240.0), kabs: 6, kab_every: (200.0, 400.0), su25: 3, su25_every: (240.0, 480.0)),
    // The drone team behind the village. By October 2023 the Russians found a Mavic pilot less often than in
    // February, but still.
    operator: (pos: (900.0, -1400.0), found_per_hour: 0.2),

    // The day (c11 §2 19-20 Oct, §6 set piece 2): the guns again, then four groups of 15-22 under more smoke, the
    // infantry dismounting at the belts and walking the last kilometre; and from mid-morning the heap stormed on foot,
    // tanks at its base, men climbing the face under the drone's drops (folded in from about 16 October).
    script: [
        (2.0, Say("Bird up. Overcast, a strong wind from the west. Holding is hard work today.")),
        (
            10.0,
            Say(
                "All, this is {command}. They are forming up beyond the heap and at Krasnohorivka again. Same as the tenth.",
            ),
        ),
        (20.0, Prep(missions: 8, over: 200.0)),
        (
            150.0,
            Bombs(
                from: (1150.0, -820.0),
                to: (1000.0, -700.0),
                n: 2,
                label: "07:10  KABs on Stepove",
                say: "Su-34s. Bombs on the village again. Down.",
            ),
        ),
        (
            210.0,
            Column(
                route: 0,
                kinds: [T72, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2, T80, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2, T72, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, Bmp2],
                plow: true,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 4,
                label: "07:25  The first group, under smoke, on Stepove",
            ),
        ),
        (220.0, Jam(0.6)),
        (235.0, Say("Bird: a column from Krasnohorivka again. Smaller. A lot of smoke, I can't count them.")),
        (
            300.0,
            Infantry(route: 0, groups: 8, size: 6, every: 15.0, label: "07:50  Their infantry dismounts at the belts"),
        ),
        (
            380.0,
            Column(
                route: 1,
                kinds: [T80, Bmp2, Bmp2, T72, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp1, Bmp2, T80],
                plow: true,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 3,
                label: "08:10  Tanks to the foot of the heap",
            ),
        ),
        (400.0, Infantry(route: 2, groups: 12, size: 6, every: 12.0, label: "08:15  Men on the heap's face")),
        // Su-25s on the heap's trench as the storming parties climb (c11 §2: the Su-25s forced in close by 19 October,
        // five aircraft claimed in ten days).
        (
            430.0,
            Air([
                (kind: Su25, from: (-3400.0, 6000.0), via: [(-2900.0, 4800.0)], at: (-950.0, 480.0)),
                (kind: Su25, from: (-3100.0, 6000.0), via: [(-2700.0, 4800.0)], at: (-980.0, 500.0), delay: 8.0),
            ]),
        ),
        (420.0, Say("This is {op}. They are climbing. The face, below us. Tanks at the foot, firing up.")),
        (
            560.0,
            Bombs(
                from: (-1050.0, 520.0),
                to: (-950.0, 440.0),
                n: 2,
                label: "",
                say: "KABs on the heap!",
            ),
        ),
        (
            700.0,
            Column(
                route: 0,
                kinds: [
                    T72, Bmp2, Bmp2, Bmp1, Mtlb, Bmp2, T72, Bmp1, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp2, Bmp1, T80, Bmp2, Bmp2, Mtlb,
                ],
                plow: false,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 4,
                label: "09:35  A second group on Stepove, past the first's wrecks",
            ),
        ),
        (720.0, Infantry(route: 0, groups: 8, size: 6, every: 15.0)),
        (740.0, Tos(label: "TOS-1A on the village")),
        (800.0, Infantry(route: 2, groups: 10, size: 6, every: 12.0, label: "10:00  The heap again, on foot")),
        // A pair on Stepove's east edge.
        (
            830.0,
            Air([
                (kind: Su25, from: (2100.0, 6500.0), via: [(1800.0, 4600.0)], at: (1000.0, -760.0)),
                (kind: Su25, from: (2400.0, 6500.0), via: [(2000.0, 4600.0)], at: (1200.0, -900.0), delay: 8.0),
            ]),
        ),
        (
            1000.0,
            Column(
                route: 1,
                kinds: [T72, Bmp1, Bmp2, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp1, Bmp2, T72, Mtlb, Bmp2, Bmp2, Bmp1],
                plow: false,
                start: 300.0,
                smoke: 2,
                label: "10:50  The last of the armour, from the east",
            ),
        ),
        (1020.0, Jam(0.6)),
        (1100.0, Infantry(route: 2, groups: 8, size: 6, every: 14.0, label: "11:15  More men onto the face")),
        (1250.0, Say("This is {op}. They have a foothold on the north face. Not the top. Not today.")),
    ],
)
